note pabrun: in the work folder: git bundle unbundle <item>/head.bundle, then git diff --no-color
note --no-ext-diff --no-textconv <base>...<head> (the importer's own diff form), both with pakwt's
note settings through fexec (argv only): 0 the output is kept as the cache file, 2 it is over fxo
note (not kept), 3 git or the disk failed
fn pabrun to ulong
pakwt
fka tpbund
fka tpunb
fkopen
papid tpfbn
pakp
r = fexec PATMO
if ne r 0
ret 3
end
pakwt
fka tpdiff
